        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4622, 12 Inch Urn Tip Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Urn Tip Appliance Pull is beautiful. The decorative tips really add a subtle point of interest to the piece that is classic and also current with today's decorating trends. Made by RK International, this 12 Inch Urn Tip Refrigerator Pull can be used not only on the refrigerator but also on all your kitchen's appliances for a cohesive look. It is available in 7 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/plain-pull-with-decorative-ends-rk-international-cp-815\"><b>Urn Tip Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AP-PH-4622 Plain Refrigerator Handle with Decorative Ends:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
